{"id":"638077","name":"苏式椒盐月饼","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/638077/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"120克"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"40克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"25克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1克"},{"name":"水","amount":"50克"}],"sub":[{"name":"低筋面粉","amount":"100克"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"50克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好花生米、花椒、核桃仁，放入空气炸锅中，180度，烤8分钟。","img":"images/638077/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"晾凉。","img":"images/638077/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"我们来做水油皮部分，主料中所有的食材放入一个大碗中。","img":"images/638077/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/638077/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅成絮状。","img":"images/638077/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉成一个光滑的面团，盖上保鲜膜，松弛20分钟。","img":"images/638077/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"准备油酥部分的面粉。","img":"images/638077/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入猪油。","img":"images/638077/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"抓匀冷藏备用。","img":"images/638077/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"烤好的花生、核桃仁、花椒一起放入料理机，打成粉，备用。","img":"images/638077/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"克面粉放入空气炸锅，180度，烤5分钟。","img":"images/638077/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"得到熟面粉(糕粉)。","img":"images/638077/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"熟面粉+熟白芝麻(提前烤熟)+糖+盐+花生碎+花椒粉+核桃粉+猪油+玉米油(椒盐馅的所有的材料)，放入一个碗中，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/638077/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"用手能抓成团即可。","img":"images/638077/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"分成均匀的12等分，椒盐馅就做好了，放入冰箱冷藏，备用。","img":"images/638077/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"取出松弛好的油皮。","img":"images/638077/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"分成均匀的12等分。","img":"images/638077/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"团圆，取出油酥面团，也同样分成12等分。","img":"images/638077/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"取出一个油皮面团，按成圆形。","img":"images/638077/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"包入一个油酥，团成圆形。","img":"images/638077/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"依次全部做完，月饼皮就做好了，盖上保鲜膜，放入冰箱冷藏松弛20分钟，备用。","img":"images/638077/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"取出一个月饼皮面团，开始第一次擀卷。","img":"images/638077/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"擀成长舌状。","img":"images/638077/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"从上往下卷起。","img":"images/638077/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"依次全部做完，盖上保鲜膜，放冰箱冷藏松弛20分钟。","img":"images/638077/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"时间结束后，取出一个面团，开始第二次擀卷。","img":"images/638077/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"擀长。","img":"images/638077/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"卷起。","img":"images/638077/step_28.jpg"},{"step":29,"desc":"依次全部做完，盖上保鲜膜，以免风干。","img":"images/638077/step_29.jpg"},{"step":30,"desc":"取出一个面团。","img":"images/638077/step_30.jpg"},{"step":31,"desc":"两头往中间压一下。","img":"images/638077/step_31.jpg"},{"step":32,"desc":"擀成圆的面片。","img":"images/638077/step_32.jpg"},{"step":33,"desc":"包入一个椒盐馅。","img":"images/638077/step_33.jpg"},{"step":34,"desc":"捏紧(包包子样的)。","img":"images/638077/step_34.jpg"},{"step":35,"desc":"收口捏紧。","img":"images/638077/step_35.jpg"},{"step":36,"desc":"收口朝下，依次摆入烤盘中。","img":"images/638077/step_36.jpg"},{"step":37,"desc":"准备好少许红色食用色素。","img":"images/638077/step_37.jpg"},{"step":38,"desc":"用印章在饼中间盖上红印。","img":"images/638077/step_38.jpg"},{"step":39,"desc":"全部盖完。","img":"images/638077/step_39.jpg"},{"step":40,"desc":"放入预热好的烤箱，中层，180度，烤30分钟，中间加盖锡纸。","img":"images/638077/step_40.jpg"},{"step":41,"desc":"好了，出炉了。","img":"images/638077/step_41.jpg"},{"step":42,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/638077/step_42.jpg"},{"step":43,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/638077/step_43.jpg"},{"step":44,"desc":"层层叠叠，酥得掉渣。","img":"images/638077/step_44.jpg"},{"step":45,"desc":"香气四溢。","img":"images/638077/step_45.jpg"},{"step":46,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/638077/step_46.jpg"},{"step":47,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/638077/step_47.jpg"},{"step":48,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/638077/step_48.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}